{"changelog":"## 功能\n\n- 支持原生相机使用 OPPO 哈苏磁吸闪光灯：自动/手动闪光、闪光强度、常亮亮度及色温调节。\n- 支持闪光灯开机发现弹窗、NFC 碰一碰互联。\n- 修复相机内闪光灯面板展开、收起及控件显示异常。\n- 提供 Compose / ColorOS 官方组件双界面，支持系统主题色和多语言。\n- 显示相机、设备空间的注入状态与适配结果，自动同步 Xposed 作用域。\n- 移除品牌限制，允许真我、OPPO 及保留兼容组件的移植系统尝试增强；原生已支持的设备自动跳过。\n\n## 使用范围\n\n面向 ColorOS 16、OxygenOS 16、realme UI 7.0。已实测一加 15；真我 GT8 Pro ROM 静态检查通过，尚待真机验证；OxygenOS 16 待验证。\n\n需要支持现代 Xposed API 102 的框架。启用「相机」「设备空间」作用域后，按模块提示重启目标应用；首次启用如互联未生效，可重启手机。打开一次相机并等待初始化完成，再连接闪光灯。\n\n包名：`com.daxiaamu.opluscameraenhance`  \n版本：`0.3.9`（versionCode `17`）\r\n","channel":"stable","maxForcedVersionCode":0,"policyRevision":1,"publishedAt":"2026-09-06T17:20:42Z","schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"f89f1a8429de420a9cd740de08a330047d3fea3698d07fca43da7dea2a35d938","size":24931252,"urls":["https://ghfast.top/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://ghproxy.net/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh.llkk.cc/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh.monlor.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://ghproxy.vip/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh.jasonzeng.dev/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh.3w.pm/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://gh-proxy.org/https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/releases/download/v0.3.9/OPlusCameraEnhance-0.3.9-release.apk","https://github.com/daxiaamu/OPlusCameraEnhance/release